{
  "correspondence": "Aircraft map to loans, routes to galleries, gates to slots, maintenance windows to reservations, crew assignments to approvals, and flight manifests to notes. The scheduling controller's authority over gate assignments mirrors the museum's gallery authority, and the immutable flight creation log parallels artifact provenance. Both systems enforce narrow pre-issued approvals for restricted operations and maintain atomic transaction semantics for batch assignments.",
